Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Legends of Sports Heroes: Dunk for Victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.80,Title,,0,0,0,,Wholeheartedly
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:36.96,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued…
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,In the previous episode, the little goats arrived at the arena at the last second
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.32,0:00:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and faced off against Vera.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Vera replicated the signature moves of the four top captains.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.08,0:00:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie led the team in a fierce battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Wolffy secretly went to rescue the two senior goats,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but was knocked unconscious by a robot lying in ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You think {\i1}you{\i0} can stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, everyone; I’m completely fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Still talking tough?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.76,0:01:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Vera!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.76,0:01:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,—Vera!　—Then…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,let’s continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.52,0:01:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to reclaim…the honor my family lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.28,0:01:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, you won’t get a single point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A fierce attack—Vera is unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.92,0:01:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders is in a truly desperate situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.40,0:01:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the little goats are getting completely overwhelmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.76,0:01:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If only their coach were here…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.56,0:01:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That machine…how dare it ambush me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain? You’re here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.68,0:02:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What…what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.72,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, I’m getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.44,0:02:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re trying to get out through the vent, aren’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.04,0:02:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are something, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.72,0:02:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if we can actually get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.52,0:02:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s the exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.80,0:02:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.72,0:02:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Is anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.52,0:02:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Is anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.20,0:02:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop shouting; there are lots of robots out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.56,0:02:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Blazey, your leg…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,An old injury must have flared up while I was controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:02:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly is going on with that injured leg of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.84,0:03:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn’t it getting any better?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.60,0:03:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve been friends for over a decade; is there anything you can’t tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t bottle it up inside—getting it off your chest will make you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It all started with Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor placed great importance on his first official match.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.84,0:03:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end, he lost the game because of his teammates’ poor performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.16,0:03:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,From then on, he never trusted his teammates again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,On the court, he only trusted himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.88,0:03:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He became increasingly headstrong and domineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.12,0:03:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, he went out to train alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.76,0:03:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried about him…so I secretly followed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.84,0:03:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A torrential rainstorm hit that day; it was extremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.24,0:03:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, Victor got caught in a landslide.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.12,0:03:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, I was nearby and managed to rescue him in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.00,0:04:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just then…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Rocks came tumbling down the mountain, and one of them crushed my leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.72,0:04:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,After I got Victor to the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.76,0:04:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.52,0:04:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected that when I met him again, he would be there to challenge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But because of that one-on-one match, my leg injury flared up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So, he was the one who saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hate Victor, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate him? How could I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.36,0:04:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though he no longer acknowledges me as his master…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.08,0:04:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,in my heart, he has always been the student I’m most proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.52,0:04:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s just that I didn’t teach him well enough…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.88,0:04:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since then, I haven’t dared to coach basketball.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:05:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I’m a failed basketball coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.60,0:05:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Blazey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You are an excellent basketball coach—I guarantee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.96,0:05:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Better than you, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Traveling violation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.80,0:05:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Vera’s defensive pressure is overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.88,0:05:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s causing Team Defenders to make a series of unforced errors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.08,0:05:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Team Defenders is done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The gap in skill is just too huge; Team Wolves is terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.16,0:05:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders has already given it their all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.64,0:06:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Pantheress.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She…she’s awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re the team that beat Team Sonic—pull yourselves together!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.60,0:06:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right; you weren’t like this when you played against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t let you go easy on them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.24,0:06:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think they’re cheering for you sincerely?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you don’t win the championship, they’ll despise you just the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.68,0:06:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Team Defenders!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.20,0:06:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Go…Go, Team Wolves…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:06:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.56,0:07:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The most important skill for a power forward…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.36,0:07:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,…is anticipating where the ball will land after bouncing off the rim,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.56,0:07:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and moving a step ahead of everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.04,0:07:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever controls the rebounds…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,…dominates the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.44,0:07:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.84,0:07:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show you the results of my special training.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you learn that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.04,0:07:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t see that coming, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it—I knew one day you’d definitely be able to dunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie…stop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.32,0:08:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.16,0:08:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,—Good!　—Great pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.16,0:08:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go—they’re picking up the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.76,0:08:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders are starting to close the gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.12,0:08:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Think they can actually take the lead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.76,0:08:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now {\i1}that’s{\i0} more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.48,0:08:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Coach and Captain have a history like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.84,0:09:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.32,0:09:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hostile intrusion; eliminate immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.12,0:09:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know kung fu?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.20,0:09:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven’t you seen {\i1}Against the Dark Force{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hostile intrusion; eliminate immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, Slowy, we’re here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.44,0:09:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.36,0:09:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This time…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:09:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,it’s my turn to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.52,0:10:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.44,0:10:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it looks like this place is about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.76,0:10:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Make a run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.44,0:10:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Encouraged by their supporters, Team Defenders is surging with momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.00,0:10:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The score gap is narrowing; how will Team Wolves respond?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.36,0:10:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.84,0:10:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s it—slowly close the gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.44,0:10:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.60,0:10:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t actually think you can beat me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.96,0:10:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:10:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.60,0:11:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A Sonic Fast Break followed immediately by a Eagle Dunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.52,0:11:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If this shot goes in,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.12,0:11:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the momentum Team Defenders worked so hard to build will be instantly shattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.56,0:11:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This shot could even decide the outcome of the entire game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.36,0:11:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,As Team Wolves’ future star player,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m looking forward to facing you on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.32,0:11:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, we promised to meet in the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.44,0:11:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let’s give it our all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll see each other on the court again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re carrying everyone’s hopes…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,as we take each step to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.48,0:11:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s why we won’t lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.36,0:11:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The championship is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.04,0:12:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They stopped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.08,0:12:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders actually managed to stop Vera’s super attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.08,0:12:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.40,0:12:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.96,0:12:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys stopped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.44,0:12:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.32,0:12:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That was an amazing defensive play.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.08,0:12:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys were great.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
